# 换行统一：源码用 LF，Windows 批处理保留 CRLF
#
# Linux 上跑的 .sh、以及带 shebang 的脚本必须是 LF，否则 CI 会报
# "bad interpreter: /bin/sh^M"。这件事只能靠 .gitattributes 保证，
# 靠本地 core.autocrlf 设置不靠谱。
* text=auto eol=lf

*.bat  text eol=crlf
*.cmd  text eol=crlf
*.ps1  text eol=crlf

*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
*.gif  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
*.db   binary
*.apk  binary